{
  "title": "Coupling-modulated ring, 106.25 GBd PAM4 flow",
  "group": "Lasers & modulators",
  "description": "Example 47's coupling-modulated ring at 106.25 GBd PAM4 with a four-step testbench flow: find the resonance at the drive bias, run a PAM4 eye at a laser detuning, optimize detuning, arm imbalance and drive bias for relOMA under RLM / TDECQ / ER constraints, then evaluate the best design over a full PRBS-13Q period against the spec (RLM > 0.95, TDECQ < 1.5 dB, relOMA > -2 dB, ER > 3.5 dB)",
  "schematic": {
    "notes": [
      {
        "x": 40,
        "y": -340,
        "title": "Coupling-modulated ring at 106.25 GBd — a testbench flow",
        "lines": [
          "Example 47's ring (MZI coupler of two 400 um PN shifters,",
          "series push-pull) at 106.25 GBd PAM4. Run panel -> Flow:",
          "1 Find resonance: DC wavelength sweep with the drive",
          "  parked at vbias (the sqrt-law PN moves the resonance",
          "  with bias) -> lam_res.",
          "2 PAM4 eye: LAS at lam_res - detune_pm; 1000 symbols;",
          "  stateye -> rlm, er_db, rel_oma_db, il_db, tdecq_db.",
          "3 Optimize: detune_pm and vbias, re-running 1+2 per",
          "  evaluation: maximize relOMA s.t. RLM >= 0.96,",
          "  TDECQ <= 1.3 dB, ER >= 4 dB (margin over the spec).",
          "4 Evaluate: the optimum over a full PRBS-13Q period",
          "  (OMA_outer) with the Eye tab's stateye settings, against",
          "  RLM > 0.95, TDECQ < 1.5 dB, relOMA > -2 dB, ER > 3.5 dB.",
          "Drive: 3 Vpp (vswing; 2 Vpp tops out near relOMA -3 dB),",
          "5 ps edges, 0.02 UI RJ/SJ/DJ (the 0.05 UI defaults alone",
          "cost ~2 dB of TDECQ). Optimum: ~3.2 pm blue, vbias ~2.4 V",
          "-> relOMA -1.79 dB, RLM 0.96, TDECQ 0.63 dB, ER 7.4 dB.",
          "Quasi-static optics, as in example 47 (no photon lifetime).",
          "Add dL_nm (arm imbalance) to the optimizer to explore it."
        ]
      }
    ],
